// They are a stray ("yes") when their ebb is more than 100 away from zero in either direction, and
// otherwise "no" (also "no" while their ebb is "n/a").
// The sheet's stray count is how many of its people are strays.
// The sheet's final total is the sum of the scaled of its people whose state is FINAL, counting
// "n/a" as zero.
// The sheet's ledger is the grand total of everyone's scaled, leaving out anyone whose scaled is "n/a",
// and leaving out the single highest scaled as an outlier (that person stays on the sheet).
// The sheet's grand scaled is everyone's scaled added together, leaving out anyone whose scaled is "n/a"
// (0 when nobody has a scaled).
// The sheet's tier tally shows how many of its people are in each tier, SURGE, STEADY and SINK (zero when
// none are); people without a tier are not counted.
// The sheet's tier share shows, for each tier, SURGE, STEADY and SINK, its tally as a percentage of the
// sheet's headcount, rounded down ("n/a" when the sheet has nobody on it).
// The sheet's tier ledger shows the total momentum of its people in each tier, SURGE, STEADY and SINK (zero
// when none are); people without a tier add nothing.
// The sheet's top per tier shows, for each tier, SURGE, STEADY and SINK, the name of the person in it with
// the highest scaled, ties going to the name earlier in the alphabet ("n/a" when none of them have a scaled).
// The sheet's stratum counts show how many of its people are in each stratum, TOP and BOT (zero when
// none are); people whose stratum is "n/a" are not counted.
// The sheet's band counts show how many of its people are in each band, A through E (zero when none
// are); people whose band is "n/a" are not counted.
